** Mapping Fixes to Checks

| Fix (schema-cleanup.org)                        | Validates with check           |
|-------------------------------------------------+--------------------------------|
| =add-iri-fn=: EvidenceStrengthAssertion → Statement | =:has-kafka-iri=           |
| =assertion-query= in sepio_model.clj            | =:has-legacy-website-id=       |
| =approval-activity-query=: bfo/realizes → activityType | =:has-legacy-website-id=  |
| =add_legacy_website_id.sparql=                  | =:has-legacy-website-id=       |
| =validation.clj= disconnected lines check       | =:no-disconnected-evidence-lines= |
| =website_events.clj= Unpublisher → Unpublished  | =:unpublish-has-date=, website event spec |
| Statement contribution terms                    | =:has-evaluated-contribution=, =:has-submitted-contribution= |

** Suggested Fix Order

Apply fixes in this order to minimize cascading failures and make progress
visible after each step:

1. =add_legacy_website_id.sparql= — isolated SPARQL change, no Clojure
2. =validation.clj= — fixes the test harness itself; must come early
3. =sepio_model.clj= =assertion-query= + =approval-activity-query= — legacy ID
4. =gene_validity.clj= =add-iri-fn= — Kafka key; fixes =:has-kafka-iri=
5. =website_events.clj= =:cg/Unpublisher= → =:cg/Unpublished= — fixes unpublish detection
6. =user.clj= query updates — dev experience only, no production impact
